# Gold-set working artifacts. Every one of these is derived from
# attic-favorites*.json (gitignored PII) and carries real captions, creator
# handles and URLs — the sample, the pre-annotation payload, and the founder's
# adjudicated gold alike. The gold set itself is the artifact we intend to
# publish, but only after a deliberate review pass, never by accident.
# eval/gold/fixtures/ is exempt: those are synthetic by construction.
eval/gold/out/
eval/gold/*.jsonl
eval/gold/*.json
!eval/gold/fixtures/**

# promptfoo replay slice — esbuild prebundle of the TS grounding engine (build artifact)
eval-promptfoo/.bundle/
.scratch/
